Z||000000||My7Fieros||06-20-2000||06:36 PM||||"Smooth" by Santana, "I stumble"(or whatever) by Mary K.Blyth (or whatever again),  that song about a girl who cries a river and floods the whole world...by 9 Days I believe, and all those Christina Aguleira songs....eeekkk!!! For the most part, they're pretty ok songs, but how many times a day do they have to play them?<BR>I remember when I was a junior or senior in high school, I heard "Pour some sugar on me" by Def Leppard SOOOOOOO many times, that I STILL know every word to it, and I havnt listened to it in 10 years!! AAARGGGG!||||reg||8
